{
  "id": "restricted-three-body-phy",
  "name": "Restricted Three-Body Problem (Simplified)",
  "description": "Simplified restricted three-body problem showing motion of a small mass in the gravitational field of two larger masses (e.g., Earth-Moon system). Based on classical orbital mechanics. Reference: Szebehely, V. (1967). Theory of Orbits: The Restricted Problem of Three Bodies. Academic Press. Source: https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-12-395732-0.X5001-6\n\nIdentifier reconciliation 2026-10-20: undeclared shorthand is explicitly mapped to existing declared quantities. This preserves the authored scalar mathematics, IDs, inputs, topology and layout. It does not recover an original executable source or establish parameter calibration/scientific fidelity; existing conceptual references remain unverified for these equations.",
